# Quicknode Provider

Manage your Quicknode blockchain infrastructure as code: RPC endpoints, security
rules, and rate limits, through `terraform plan` and `terraform apply`.

## Authentication

The provider authenticates with a Quicknode [Admin API](https://www.quicknode.com/docs/admin-api)
key, available on paid plans. Set it in the environment rather than in a
configuration file:

```sh
export QUICKNODE_API_KEY="your-api-key"
```

